{"id":382,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire"],"text":"Kyogre is said to be the personification of the sea itself. Legends tell of its many clashes against Groudon, as each sought to gain the power of nature."},{"games":["Omega Ruby"],"text":"Through Primal Reversion and with nature’s full power, it will take back its true form. It can summon storms that cause the sea levels to rise."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"A mythical Pokémon said to have swelled the seas with rain and tidal waves. It battled with Groudon."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"This POKéMON is said to have expanded the sea by bringing heavy rains. It has the power to control water."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"KYOGRE has appeared in mythology as the creator of the sea. After long years of feuding with GROUDON, it took to sleep at the bottom of the sea."},{"games":["Sapphire"],"text":"KYOGRE is named in mythology as the POKéMON that expanded the sea by covering the land with torrential rains and towering tidal waves. It took to sleep after a cataclysmic battle with GROUDON."},{"games":["Ruby"],"text":"KYOGRE has the power to create massive rain clouds that cover the entire sky and bring about torrential downpours. This POKéMON saved people who were suffering from droughts."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Drizzle","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon makes it rain when it enters a battle."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":120,"baseHappiness":0,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"sea","color":"Blue","shape":"Fish","evolution":{"id":382,"name":"Kyogre","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,34],[1,184],[1,246],[1,352],[1,618],[9,401],[18,347],[27,330],[36,58],[45,329],[54,392],[72,56],[81,38],[90,323]],"machine":[419,59,34,280